{
  "description": "The POST /databases/<engine> creates are documented with no body, but they return 201 with {uuid, internal_db_url?, external_db_url?} (DatabasesController::createdDatabasePayload). The Database model documents internal_db_url and external_db_url as containing the password but does not mark them sensitive. Connection URLs are marked sensitive in both. Evidence: coollabsio/coolify main @ 5c987814 (2026-11-24).",
